<%- include('partials/head') %>
<section class="wrap narrow section">
  <h1 class="page-title">How Budget Brokers works</h1>
  <div class="prose">
    <p>We list only <strong>budget rentals under ₹10,000 per month</strong> in and around Kochi – rooms, flats, PGs, hostels, houses and small shops. Browsing is completely free.</p>
    <h3>Unlocking contact numbers</h3>
    <ol>
      <li>Create a free account with your name, email and mobile number.</li>
      <li>Open any property and tap <em>Unlock for ₹<%= settings.unlock_price %></em>.</li>
      <li>Scan the UPI QR code with Google Pay, PhonePe, Paytm or any UPI app and pay ₹<%= settings.unlock_price %>.</li>
      <li>Copy the <strong>Transaction ID</strong> of the payment from your UPI app and submit it.</li>
      <li>Our team manually verifies the payment, usually within a few hours. Once approved, that property’s owner or broker number is unlocked and stays in <em>My account</em> – no expiry.</li>
      <li>Want another property? Unlock it the same way – each property is ₹<%= settings.unlock_price %>.</li>
    </ol>
    <h3>Where do I find the Transaction ID?</h3>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Google Pay:</strong> open the payment → “UPI transaction ID”.</li>
      <li><strong>PhonePe:</strong> History → the payment → “Transaction ID”.</li>
      <li><strong>Paytm:</strong> Balance &amp; History → the payment → “UPI Ref No”.</li>
    </ul>
    <p>Payment rejected by mistake? <% if (settings.support_whatsapp) { %><a href="https://wa.me/<%= settings.support_whatsapp %>" target="_blank" rel="noopener">WhatsApp us</a> with a screenshot<% } else { %>Contact support<% } %> and we will sort it out.</p>
  </div>
</section>
<%- include('partials/foot') %>
